### 🌟 About MeLovePDF
**[MeLovePDF](https://www.melovepdf.com)** is an open, high-performance web platform designed to eliminate daily file limits, forced watermarks, and expensive subscriptions. Built with modern WebAssembly hardware acceleration and private browser sandbox security, it delivers workstation-grade document and image manipulation right inside the web browser.

---

### 🚀 Core Capabilities

#### 📄 PDF Powerhouse
- **Dual-Tier PDF Compression:** Exact 0-byte target size matching (100KB, 200KB, custom) with crisp vector font preservation.
- **Bi-Directional Conversions:** PDF to Word (clean OpenXML DrawingML schemas), Word to PDF, Excel, PowerPoint, and JPG.
- **Organization & Security:** Merge, split, rotate, watermark, page numbering, 256-bit AES protection, and digital signatures.

#### 🖼️ Image & Media Studio
- **Online Photo Editor:** Creative filters, exposure adjustments, and artistic typography in browser memory.
- **Next-Gen Formats:** Fast batch conversions for HEIC/HEIF (iOS), WebP, JPG, and PNG with alpha transparency.
- **Everyday Media Utilities:** HD video extraction (TikTok, Instagram Reels, Facebook, YouTube, Pinterest, Twitter/X) without watermarks.

#### 🤖 AI-Powered Intelligence
- **Deep Neural OCR:** Multi-language text recognition with structural formatting retention.
- **AI PDF Summarizer:** Instant document breakdown, table parsing, and interactive document chat.

---

### 🛡️ Privacy & Architecture Highlights
- **Zero-Storage Retention:** Files are processed dynamically in temporary volatile buffers and immediately incinerated upon download.
- **Client-Side First:** Wherever possible, transformations run locally via WebAssembly, minimizing cloud latency and bandwidth consumption.
- **ISO 32000-1 Compliant:** All PDF outputs strictly adhere to international PDF and PDF/A archiving standards.

